Figure 5: 
Schematic views of the basic electrode structure in triaxial $\mu$-PIC.
a) Cross-section image of pixel electrodes;
b) anode strips placed at the backside of the glass substrate;
c) lower-side cathode (V-cathode) strips placed on the glass substrate;
d) upper-side cathode (U-cathode) strips placed on the polyimide.
The dotted line in b), c), and d) represents the center of each strip.
